CLAUDE.md

# A project's credential schema is tracked; a project's values are not.
# The schema declares names, types and example values, and never a value, so it is
# safe in git and required to be there. Everything else under `.env` is not.
.env
.env.*
!.guarden/.env.schema

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
*.tar.gz
*.dump
evidence/
